    "instant_rc_omxccj_vg_bfns4i_BqYFFJ": {
      "type": "instant-rcOmxccjVgBfns4i",
      "name": "MODERN USP SECTION",
      "settings": {
        "text_bsM7mn5Px5bfegVv": "<h3>why we're built different</h3>",
        "text_f6W8dYY1pHJylaPL": "<p>all-in-one</p>",
        "text_N7xNRCEoalD39NFq": "<p>One scoop a day covers strength, focus, energy, recovery, and hydration.</p>",
        "text_tSEzmIPcrIKoamgT": "<p>clinical doses</p>",
        "text_1LBt2YVOBddl7hNf": "<p>No fairy dust. Every ingredient is included at real, effective levels.</p>",
        "text_xqikiqJZEWkUZmmC": "<p>zero bloat</p>",
        "text_dc2OuGhDZMjVCWTf": "<p>No fillers, no junk. Just clean performance your body actually uses.</p>",
        "text_D4UkFpbtznWO75aM": "<p>stimulant-free</p>",
        "text_sNrbUaPSD3Y88xjN": "<p>Get steady, natural energy without the caffeine, crash, or jitters.</p>",
        "text_s03F3braViXNOr1R": "<p>saves time</p>",
        "text_iySxj97eAbqSVh97": "<p>Skip the 8-pill routine. Every Damn Day simplifies your stack in seconds.</p>",
        "text_aEnQXIf5qkNikaB7": "<p>built for men</p>",
        "text_PXRt7WbLdvpjhQEe": "<p>Designed specifically for men who want to feel, perform, and live better.</p>",
        "url_rgVuvNFThoczrBiQ": "shopify://products/everydamnday",
        "text_IIdPJQK6Pb2ANl94": "<p>Try risk-free now</p>",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "instant_wi_fc6_j_yn1n_erm1_qy_Jdnkn9": {
      "type": "instant-WiFc6JYn1nERM1QY",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "MODERN FORMULA SECTION",
      "settings": {
        "text_NB4fjT0t2qHEdeqk": "<p>OUR FORMULA</p>",
        "text_cRK8tnhHaaCWTrBM": "<h3>Built to</h3>",
        "text_0Mzcj63KtiUDxWIX": "<h3>Power you up.</h3>",
        "text_IxiuehxYvXo3G7kQ": "<p>One daily scoop. Clinically dosed. No bullshit. Every Damn Day delivers the goods to power your day, every damn day.</p>",
        "text_vRCsbEKyRkm6DYGK": "<h3>Creatine monohydrate</h3>",
        "text_bs0Cqj3WL8yMMrgv": "<h3>5 grams</h3>",
        "text_ImYdxFO2bLApRDhz": "<p>Clinically proven to boost strength, muscle power, and recovery by increasing ATP - your body's primary energy source for high-intensity performance. Creatine also enhances brain energy metabolism, supporting sharper thinking, better memory, and improved mental performance under stress.</p>",
        "text_HAFTz3SbPBCWXaED": "<h3>l-citrulline</h3>",
        "text_2JVdHRnTtZRW5Ll1": "<h3>4 grams</h3>",
        "text_QMiCqjtRDqnozwes": "<p>Enhances blood flow and oxygen delivery by increasing nitric oxide production - supporting endurance, reducing fatigue, and powering better performance in every moment.</p>",
        "text_xy8G4sCUsf6eJbcq": "<h3>alpha-gpc</h3>",
        "text_jHx62yE7LHiYKuuM": "<h3>600 milligrams</h3>",
        "text_b33zTQDVN4qyi8qt": "<p>Elevates mental clarity, focus, and reaction time by increasing acetylcholine - a key a neurotransmitter for cognitive and physical performance.</p>",
        "text_KBWMEQsoIksMZwpt": "<h3>L-theanine</h3>",
        "text_Huq3ZDNDKjbx9gZR": "<h3>300 milligrams</h3>",
        "text_TcxJqjVlJoPuLvOF": "<p>Promotes calm, focused concentration by supporting alpha brain waves - helping reduce stress without drowsiness.</p>",
        "text_oWwrVBTPYreBV9Qk": "<h3>Acetyl-l-carnitine</h3>",
        "text_Ni8zQfIJ3IJIc9yC": "<h3>1.5 grams</h3>",
        "text_pmVmob8oMYDAeA2t": "<p>Supports cellular energy and mental clarity by transporting fatty acids into mitochondria, helping fuel both your body and brain while reducing fatigue.</p>",
        "text_n35fc4oD2MOPK27x": "<h3>Glycine</h3>",
        "text_mFK9NcD3SxWD26vN": "<h3>3 grams</h3>",
        "text_3xQfPdC1GfBNd1hf": "<p>Supports muscle recovery, joint health, and deeper sleep by promoting collagen production and calming the nervous system, helping your body repair and recharge every damn day.</p>",
        "text_3xjXf3dTAEspBCi0": "<h3>Magnesium glycinate</h3>",
        "text_g4ESe0ChNKmaugiH": "<h3>1 gram</h3>",
        "text_VAPxHUVGDSc6xtrU": "<p>Supports muscle relaxation, stress reduction, and recovery by helping regulate nerve function and cortisol, in a highly absorbable form that's gentle on the gut.</p>",
        "text_gU45ChrQhPcMcEGn": "<h3>electrolytes</h3>",
        "text_4LEBlsyAweyUXeu0": "<h3>750 milligrams</h3>",
        "text_aAl3maPQfweyubSy": "<p>500 milligrams of Sodium Citrate, 150 milligrams of Potassium Citrate, 100 milligrams of Potassium Chloride.</p><p></p><p>Helps maintain hydration, nerve signaling, and muscle function by balancing fluid levels inside and outside your cells, keeping your body running at full capacity without the sugar.</p><p></p><p></p>",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "instant_mrxk_exgfbpshbw_ur_4Hx87j": {
      "type": "instant-mrxkExgfbpshbwUR",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "MODERN REVIEW SECTION",
      "settings": {
        "text_avZSSSKFMopWmeCM": "<h3>what attaboys are saying...</h3>",
        "text_07WLSH7CnrudMr86": "<p>Hear from a few real dudes who upgraded their routine.</p>",
        "text_SIT5zWwQryyydAuy": "<p>Completely Worth It.</p>",
        "text_aSe3VhDSkJcWkg98": "<p>“I'm about 12 days in from starting and I can already feel differences. Lasting energy later in the day, sleeping a little better, mood swings aren't as drastic, and I feel more focused. It took about a week, maybe a little over, for me to start noticing the changes.”</p>",
        "text_lVgOkprZZKDlYKDC": "<p>Chris in Florida</p>",
        "text_MjHhCEnXuGLZfZC7": "<p>worth the hype</p>",
        "text_qHs0cbHWzvx2qH3y": "<p>“I've always hated having to buy multiple supplements and spending hundreds of dollars on all of them. I found Attaboy, and after just a week or so of using the product, I can already tell such a huge difference. I feel the effects within 10-15 minutes of my scoop every morning. Truly an incredible product.”</p>",
        "text_wIlIDQfmD0gR2Oj4": "<p>Baylor in Tennessee</p>",
        "text_OfSRdKjju9OLuMHt": "<p>checks all the boxes</p>",
        "text_6ess5Xvf4Oe4v5nb": "<p>“Clean taste and handy way to check all of the boxes.”</p>",
        "text_t1hzRoGoMMUWiuBR": "<p>PJ in Nebraska</p>",
        "text_vYCtZGRveNWvpvpp": "<p>great product and execution - gimme more...</p>",
        "text_lW7SuOZ494PpJibk": "<p>“The concept is great and I like that it's stacking all the benefits. Tastes great and definitely not too sweet or artificial.”</p>",
        "text_ggdTgLJ5yEGPgaZy": "<p>Christian in New York</p>",
        "text_UM5gdd6PP9A0I3SD": "<p>so far, so damn good</p>",
        "text_Ty43EJ5h6RlLGIMc": "<p>“love it so far, only 4 stars as it is a bit early in my use of it. Flavor is great, mixability is great. So far so good!”</p>",
        "text_CFCrlMpC04cZzqwx": "<p>Jeremy in New York</p>",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
