      "name": "MODERN PDP INGREDIENTS",
      "settings": {
        "text_trMjruN94PN3uGGr": "<h3>Every Ingredient Earned Its Spot</h3>",
        "tab_title_c7NKBbcvPs6QJJ7d": "Strength",
        "tab_title_7PAS6KRnS8bRRe68": "New item",
        "text_ilwKxWtNcrupsk1F": "<p>strength</p>",
        "text_9GvH3FDncRw5khUR": "<p>Strength isn’t just about lifting heavier, it’s about performing better, day after day. Every Damn Day is packed with clinically-backed ingredients that fuel muscle power, support ATP production, and enhance cellular performance, so your body shows up stronger when it counts.</p>",
